# Security

- Access tokens last 15 minutes. Store refresh tokens and OTPs only as hashes.
- Do not log passwords, tokens, OTP codes, or webhook secrets.
- Customer queries filter by the authenticated user. A foreign id is 404.
- Admin routes require the section permission from `docs/product/USER_ROLES_AND_PERMISSIONS.md`.
- Verify the payment webhook signature before any write. Reject unsigned calls.
- Read `docs/engineering/SECURITY.md` before changing auth or payments.
